 "text": "Your business runs on a binder. How you pack, how you ship, how you answer a late order. Anthropic just gave Agent Skills to the Linux Foundation. A skill is just written down instructions and AI follows. 70 plus AI tools can read them now. One million skills, nearly 280 million installs. So your binder isn't locked into one app anymore. Write it once and Claude, ChatGPT or Copilot can run it. We write those binders for warehouses and online stores. Comment SYSTEMS and we'll send you the free sheet."
